[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3 uid="uid://bhnewoqap3ct2"]

; UI_POLISH_PLAN_V4 section 2 (Jeremy owns these numbers). DEFAULTS:
;   spacing steps 8 / 16 / 24 / 32 / 48 only; screen edge 32 (48 scaled to the 1280x720 window)
;   corner radius 16 panels, 12 cards, 8 chips and buttons; no borders except the selected card
;   font sizes: Title 36, Heading 24, Body 18, Small 14 (display effects like the big countdown keep their own)
;   text: off-white main, soft gray-blue quiet; panel navy ~86% see-through; card one step lighter
;   amber only for the one thing to do next and the selected card; green/red only for status

